{"4256120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black Tear", "steam_appid": 4256120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Tear is a dark 2D action-adventure game where every choice shapes your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious world filled with strange creatures, hidden paths, and unsettling truths. Combat is fast-paced and skill-based, combining classic hack-and-slash action with modern platforming mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter. Choices you make throughout the journey influence the story, characters, and lead to multiple endings.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256120/extras/7b3beaad334817304022d46bff888a93.poster.avif?t=1766105232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256120/extras/7b3beaad334817304022d46bff888a93.webm?t=1766105232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256120/extras/7b3beaad334817304022d46bff888a93.mp4?t=1766105232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast-paced 2D hack and slash combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deep exploration with metroidvania-style level design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Branching narrative with multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Crafting and equipment progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Atmospheric world with a dark, emotional tone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stylized cartoon visuals</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Tear is a dark 2D action-adventure game where every choice shapes your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious world filled with strange creatures, hidden paths, and unsettling truths. Combat is fast-paced and skill-based, combining classic hack-and-slash action with modern platforming mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter. Choices you make throughout the journey influence the story, characters, and lead to multiple endings.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256120/extras/7b3beaad334817304022d46bff888a93.poster.avif?t=1766105232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256120/extras/7b3beaad334817304022d46bff888a93.webm?t=1766105232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256120/extras/7b3beaad334817304022d46bff888a93.mp4?t=1766105232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast-paced 2D hack and slash combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deep exploration with metroidvania-style level design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Branching narrative with multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Crafting and equipment progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Atmospheric world with a dark, emotional tone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stylized cartoon visuals</p>", "short_description": "A dark 2D action-adventure with fast-paced hack and slash combat, deep exploration, and a branching story where every choice leads to a different ending.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256120/c486345dade991999d12db0ec45fa9523999006c/header.jpg?t=1766105232", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256120/87b822b7542327683e11c5b5b34b344f6fe60b49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766105232", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse